<title>UK: Citibank sets warrants on Deutsche Telekom.</title>
<headline>Citibank sets warrants on Deutsche Telekom.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank NA says it has issued 25</p>
<p>million American-style call and put warrants, in five equal</p>
<p>tranches, on Deutsche Telekom.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> WARRANTS	STRIKE	 ISS PRICE    PREMIUM     MATURITY</p>
<p> CALL A	  30.00 DEM    2.94 DEM	2.94 PCT   25.JUN.97</p>
<p> CALL B	  35.00 DEM    0.58 DEM     11.19 PCT   25.JUN.97</p>
<p> CALL C	  40.00 DEM    0.06 DEM     25.25 PCT   25.JUN.97</p>
<p> CALL D	  45.00 DEM    0.04 DEM     40.75 PCT   25.JUN.97</p>
<p> PUT E	   30.00 DEM    3.34 DEM     16.69 PCT   01.JUL.02</p>
<p> PAYDATE 27.NOV.96	LISTING DDF FFT	MIN EXER LOT ONE</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
